      "pack": "Eco Lifestyle",
      "recipe": "catalog_to_household_inventory",
      "why": "Civil Designer L5 unlocks Grow Cruelty-Free Meat on this planter; item itself is ordinary Buy/Build catalog purchase into Household Inventory",
